; XG2 NPT 5 ns：无位置限制。压耦**各向同性**（Chiariello 2023 SI p.S3：可滴定水配半各向同性会造成人为大盒形变），
; τ_p 3 ps（同上）。用 C-rescale 而非 Chiariello 的 Parrinello-Rahman：起点密度未平衡，PR 易振荡；compressibility 3e-4 同 ha2box。
integrator               = sd
dt                       = 0.010
nsteps                   = @NSTEPS@
nstxout-compressed       = 5000
nstenergy                = 500
nstcalcenergy            = 100
nstlog                   = 5000
cutoff-scheme            = Verlet
nstlist                  = 20
verlet-buffer-tolerance  = 0.005
@ELEC@
vdw_type                 = cut-off
vdw_modifier             = Potential-shift-verlet
rvdw                     = 1.1
tc-grps                  = System
tau_t                    = 1.0
ref_t                    = 310
pcoupl                   = c-rescale
pcoupltype               = isotropic
tau_p                    = 3.0
ref_p                    = 1.0
compressibility          = 3e-4
gen_vel                  = no
continuation             = yes
constraint_algorithm     = lincs
lincs_order              = 8
lincs_iter               = 2
